<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>饱食填塞 - 标签 | 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E9%A5%B1%E9%A3%9F%E5%A1%AB%E5%A1%9E/</link><description>这里不仅是我研习中医经典的私人书斋，更是一处致力于 “观照经典以明医理，颐养身心以扶正气” 的清净之地。</description><generator>Hugo 0.161.0 &amp; FixIt v1.0.0-alpha-mt895zhg</generator><language>zh-CN</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</webMaster><copyright>本站内容采用 CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 国际许可协议。</copyright><lastBuildDate>Tue, 05 May 2026 08:45:52 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E9%A5%B1%E9%A3%9F%E5%A1%AB%E5%A1%9E/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>塞治法：论气虚中满 论饱食填塞</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/2-22-sezhifa/</link><pubDate>Tue, 05 May 2026 08:44:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/2-22-sezhifa/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E4%BA%8C%E4%B9%90%E9%9B%86/">卷二乐集</category><description>本节为《石室秘录》“塞治法”部分，专论&lt;strong&gt;气虚中满与饱食填塞&lt;/strong&gt;的证治法则。核心思想是：&lt;strong&gt;因其塞而塞之&lt;/strong&gt;，即对虚性胀满、食滞之证，不可滥用消导攻伐，而当以&lt;strong&gt;补益脾胃、扶助正气&lt;/strong&gt;为主，稍佐行气消食，使正气充而胀满自消。</description></item></channel></rss>